1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
In Santiago del Estero, the season is decided before sowing.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Load your field: Field Shift reads its climate,
relief and soil with NASA data.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:17,000
It compares your rotation with alternatives and shows
what happened on your field in El Niño and La Niña years.

4
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:24,000
It warns about heat at flowering
and the water you will have at sowing.

5
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:30,000
And it tells you what to check and when: satellites give
the history, Vuelo Verde's drones confirm.
